sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant TAS as TrustyAI Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant KServe as KServe InferenceService
    participant Storage as PVC / Database

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client, Storage: Flow 1: TrustyAI Service Inference Logging
        KServe->>TAS: POST inference payload<br/>80/TCP or 443/TCP HTTP(S)
        TAS->>Storage: Store inference data<br/>Filesystem or JDBC
        Client->>Route: GET/POST request<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
        Route->>Proxy: Forward (reencrypt)<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
        Proxy->>Proxy: SubjectAccessReview<br/>Token review delegation
        Proxy->>TAS: Forward authenticated<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (localhost)
        TAS-->>Proxy: Response
        Proxy-->>Route: Encrypted response
        Route-->>Client: HTTPS response
    end

    participant LMESCtrl as LMEvalJob Controller
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Driver as ta-lmes-driver<br/>18080/TCP HTTP
    participant ModelAPI as Model API Endpoint
    participant S3 as S3/OCI/PVC<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over LMESCtrl, S3: Flow 2: LMEvalJob Execution
        LMESCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Pod spec<br/>443/TCP HTTPS SA token
        K8sAPI-->>LMESCtrl: Pod created
        Note over Driver: Init container copies<br/>driver binary
        Driver->>ModelAPI: Evaluate model<br/>configurable port HTTPS TLS
        ModelAPI-->>Driver: Evaluation results
        LMESCtrl->>Driver: GET /GetStatus<br/>18080/TCP HTTP (pod exec)
        Driver-->>LMESCtrl: JSON LMEvalJobStatus
        Driver->>S3: Upload results<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS credentials
    end

    participant EHReconciler as EvalHub Failure Reconciler
    participant EHubAPI as EvalHub API<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over EHReconciler, EHubAPI: Flow 3: EvalHub Job Failure Detection
        K8sAPI->>EHReconciler: Job/Pod failure events<br/>Watch stream
        EHReconciler->>EHubAPI: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs/{id}/events<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS service CA
        EHubAPI-->>EHReconciler: Acknowledged
    end

    participant ISvc as InferenceService Changes
    participant GORCHCtrl as GORCH Controller
    participant GORCHPod as Guardrails Orchestrator

    rect rgb(255, 240, 255)
        Note over ISvc, GORCHPod: Flow 4: GuardrailsOrchestrator Auto-Configuration
        ISvc->>GORCHCtrl: InferenceService watch event
        GORCHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Read InferenceService + ServingRuntime<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
        K8sAPI-->>GORCHCtrl: Resource details
        GORCHCtrl->>GORCHCtrl: Hash state, regenerate ConfigMap<br/>(only if hash changed)
        GORCHCtrl->>GORCHPod: Restart with new ConfigMap
        GORCHPod->>ModelAPI: Forward to detectors<br/>configurable HTTP/HTTPS
    end
